<title>UK: London silver fixes easier, looks vulnerable.</title>
<headline>London silver fixes easier, looks vulnerable.</headline>
<text>
<p>SILVER - Fixed at 427.50 cents vs 434.25 cents previously. Slipped with gold on speculative selling. No serious buying interest. Vulnerable under 430 cents.</p>
<p>GOLD - Just easier at $318.70/$319.20 down $1.90. Technically more bearish. May test $313.60 recent low.</p>
<p>PLATINUM - Holding above $400.00 at $401.00/$405.00 down $4.50.</p>
<p>PALLADIUM - Up $4.50 at $170.00/$173.00.</p>
</text>
